    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Terminator Assault Squad",
    "summary": "Once per battle, for this unit, as the battle begins, you can place a Teleport Homer token on the battlefield for this unit. If you do:\n\n- if this unit is targeted with **[Rapid Ingress](vsdata:ability/core.rapid-ingress)**, you can use that token: that use costs 1CP less, but the Stratagem then sets this unit up within 3\" of the token and more than 8\" from every enemy unit, after which the token is removed\n- if an enemy unit finishes a move up to 1\" from the token, the token is removed",
